{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10000","headline":"闻百舌鸟 · 梁鍠","name":"闻百舌鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百舌闻他郡，间关媚物华。\n敛形藏一叶，分响出千花。\n坐爱时褰幌，行藏或驻车。\n不须应独感，三载已辞家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}